"Yojaka · [READ-ONLY]                                               12,871 files "
" ╭───────────╮╭───╮╭───╮╭───╮╭───╮╭───╮                                         "
" │ 1 Actions ││ 2 ││ 3 ││ 4 ││ 5 ││ 6 │                                         "
"─┘           └┴───┴┴───┴┴───┴┴───┴┴───┴─────────────────────────────────────────"
" Ready-made jobs for /photos. Each one scans the folder, shows what is in it,   "
" asks a few questions, then runs with a progress bar. Nothing changes until you "
" confirm.                                                                       "
" To work on another folder, quit and run: yojaka <folder>                       "
"                                                                                "
" ▶ Organize or merge into folders                                               "
"     Copies or moves every photo and video into new folders: by place, by year, "
"     or all in one. Identical files are copied once.                            "
"     Scan → Summary → Layout → Destination → Confirm → Run                      "
"                                                                                "
"   Remove duplicates                                                            "
"     Finds files with exactly the same bytes and moves the extra copies to the  "
"     Trash, keeping one of each. Look-alikes are left for the Duplicates tab.   "
"     Scan → Summary → Find identical → Keep which copy → Confirm → Run          "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
" Enter start   ↑↓ choose                                1-6 tabs  ? help  q quit"
